tools.description:
Captures the next rendered frame's GPU work as a nested tree (2-3 frame
latency). Top-level entries are GPU queues (Graphics, Async Compute);
each contains its passes as a recursive subtree.

toolsets.description:
Reads and edits section channels, keys, ranges and evaluation settings. Range frames use the owning movie scene's
display rate; pre-roll and post-roll use its tick resolution. Bound changes use its playback range;
transactions are caller-owned.
